# 00 Project Foundation

## Goal
Set product context, target user value, and MVP scope discipline for Arcade Academy.

## Context
- Arcade Academy is a mobile-first educational product.
- V1 focus: quiz flow, progression, motivation, and launch readiness.
- Changes should increase learning value, retention, or MVP shippability.

## Always
- Classify work as MVP / Later / Out-of-scope before implementation.
- Define user value before building.
- Prefer simple solutions that ship reliably in V1.
- Flag non-MVP ideas explicitly as backlog candidates.

## Prohibited
- Scope creep without explicit MVP approval.
- Features with unclear user value.
- Technical choices that add avoidable V1 complexity.
